      "why": "\"Four elective courses are required for the Math major. Math Department courses numbered Math 101 and above can be used as electives except for MATH193, MATH197, and MATH198 ... In addition, there are approved out-of-department electives\". Encoded on the list below (q9WLvGzP), which now holds the whole elective requirement.",
